{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29113","headline":"宿松江驿却寄苏州一二同志 · 许浑","name":"宿松江驿却寄苏州一二同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候馆人稀夜自长，姑苏台远树苍苍。\n江湖潮落高楼迥，河汉秋归广簟凉。\n月转碧梧移鹊影，露低红叶湿萤光。\n西园诗侣应多思，莫醉笙歌掩画堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}